{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/general/off-topic/1546594-is-it-ok-to-use-someone-else-s-ai","id":1546594,"title":"Is it OK to use someone else's AI?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Additional Discussion","Off-Topic"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-12-04T11:38:12-08:00","id":1546594,"title":"Is it OK to use someone else's AI?","content":"It's interesting the questions of social protocol that arise with new technology...For instance, most would agree it's rude to just open someone else's refrigerator and go through it without their permission. But what if you're over someone's place, discussing something, and you see that they have Alexa/Google, so you use it to get some info, or even just to find out the weather for when you leave. Should you have to ask permission to do that? Would you be a little miffed if someone did that while at your place without asking first? Or if you have some music playing and they verbally change the volume or link their own phones to it to play a song for you? Maybe it's not really a big deal, but I can easily imagine people getting salty over this!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/681-hand-of-omega","name":"Hand-of-Omega","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar681_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2747"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-05T11:27:49-08:00","id":1546656,"title":"","content":"I kinda apply similar etiquette to being a passenger in someone else's car. Basic information that the tech can display (passengers can see the time and temperature on my dashboard for example)? That's fine. Messing with the settings, including the radio, is not cool. Anything actively distracting or disruptive is bad but can be less obvious since different people are distracted differently. I, for example, hate driving people that can't be quiet if they're scrolling social media. The laughing, or surprise, or whatever reactions to something I can't perceive distracts me from driving. Lots of people can tune that out.<br /> <br /> So when it comes to smart home technology, there's going to be a certain amount of just knowing your friends.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-05T11:33:10-08:00","id":1546658,"title":"","content":"Basic good manners go along way and asking permission in this instance would be the smart thing as it shows respect and courtesy for your host.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-12-08T18:27:54-08:00","id":1546778,"title":"","content":"If it one of my friends'? I would be thinking of the most embarrassing/awkward questions to ask it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;I have all the power in the world to give you, and all you have to do is beg&quot; -Nix<br /> <br /> &quot;There's thing about being a vampire, Frank; it takes a long fucking time to learn how do all the cool shit&quot;. -Abigail","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude02","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2521-iguazu","name":"Iguazu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2521_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"740"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}